Error [jet.DuplicateDefinition]: Method `cartesian` is defined twice on `Point`
  --> tests/ui/named_constructors.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     cartesian: fn(a: Float, b: Float) -> Point { return Point{x: a, y: b} }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Each method name may appear only once on a type
 Fix: Rename or remove one of the definitions
